			"notes": "This update fixed a few bug fixes and added some small features.\n\n- Better memory performance when exporting extremely large files. \n- The 3D View Port has several LOD settings, this hopefully helps performance with extremely large files. This can be enabled and disabled in the settings. If you have an extremely large scan that you want to see in full detail you will have to set **3d_viewport_settings.full_detail_when_idle** to **true**. I understand that the viewport still needs a lot of work, but hopefully this will make it a little better. \n- Migrated the mod files to client only. When I started on the first rendition of this mod I knew less about how fabric worked and created most of the stuff in the client-server side things."
